{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/6909582/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の二行日記!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"古文のテスト、いい感じにできた。地元の友達と久々にメールした!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心配していただいた数学は、頑張った。頑張ったの...(`・・')"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"414"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/6909582/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの中で「ん〜〜〜○○」って流行ってるの?(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん〜〜〜〜〜っ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きですよこのフレーズ(ω)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そいえばこの前あみあみ(能條愛未chan)が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん〜〜〜〜〜ななせまるっ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"て言ったあとのななせまるの物まね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"をしとった!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"415"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/6909582/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公式のファッションチェックひめたんのがないのはなんでなんよー(泣)←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それはひめたんがテスト週間中でお勉強頑張っとったけえよー(泣)←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの私服は気になりますかー(*^^*)？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルっぽいって言われることが多いですよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"416"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/6909582/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはチョコケーキと生クリームケーキ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちが好きですかo(^-^o)(o^-^)o？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ケーキは全部好きなんぢゃけど、どっちかって言えばチョコケーキ派かなー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんチョコが大好きなんよ(。・ω・。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"417"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/6909582/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの髪巻いてるときが可愛すぎるんですけどどうしてですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず可愛いくないけれどもっ!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"巻き巻きパワーのおかげかなー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うつり方？光の加減？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく可愛いくないけれども('`)←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"418"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/6909582/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはSPL∞ASHのメンバーとまだ会ったりしたりしてるの?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アクター行っとらんけーさすがに会えんけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまに連絡とったりはしてますよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校の話とか、夜にみた夢の話とか、お泊まりする約束したりとか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また会いたいなー(o>ω<o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"419"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/6909582/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん、髪型変えたんかな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう。ひめたんは久々にぱっつんでびゅーしました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/6909582/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幼くなりました(ω)けろ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん的には広ーいおでこが隠れてくれるのが嬉しくて嬉しくて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん的にはどうですかー?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"420"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/6909582/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるんと何食べたの???"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"421"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/6909582/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ディナー羨ましい(￣∀￣)なにを食べたのカナ?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファミレス行ったですー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるんるんと何食べたっけな。電話して聞いてみよっかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よーわからんけど美味しかったのは覚えてますよ(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるんるんとご飯行くってなったら毎回ファミレスな気がするー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だって中学生だもんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"422"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/6909582/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるんとの画像待ち受けにしちゃってもイイかな???"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"喜んでー♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恥ずかしいなーあ(*/ω＼*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"423"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/6909582/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"都会住まいに憧れる！？てか広島も都会的だけどね☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは小５の時から、どんな目的にせよ東京に住みたかったんですよー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夢叶っちゃった(。・ω・。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"424メンバーとはどんな感じで絡んでるのですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いじられキャラですかwそれともみんなの妹ひめたそ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな感じかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんやかなりんやいこまっちの永遠のアイドル...でいたいですいつまでも(ω)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりんとかみゅみゅの前では妹。よく相談事とかします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とことん甘えるのが好き('`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみあみとかななせまるとはもはやクラスメイトみたいな関係。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪がぁーるずとーぉく〜(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるんるんやいくちゃんといる時はテンションやばー上がります。落ち着きます。うん!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と勝手に偉そうに語ってみましたごめんなさい('・・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな感じ?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"425"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/6909582/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんがアイドルとして今一番身に付けたいことは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自己紹介がバシッと決まるキャッチフレーズ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何かいい案ないですかー?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"426"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/6909582/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色んな占いは信じるほう?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いい結果だけ信じるーと言いたいところぢゃけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだかんだで占いの結果はすぐすぐ忘れる人(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも占い好きですよー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"427"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/6909582/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなパンは???"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ハマってるのが焼きたてのクロワッサン!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小学校の給食に出てきそうな揚げパンも好きです(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"基本ひめたんはご飯よりパン派ぢゃけ、レーズンパン以外は喜んで食べます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"428"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/6909582/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スケートの練習をしてて危うく転びそうになったのを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"助けてくれた男の子にひとこと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"429"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/6909582/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんなんて言ったか教えてｗｗｗ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"430"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/6909582/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのセリフもう一回お願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やだ恥ずかしい絶対言わないー(o>ω<o)!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"431"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/6909582/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プレゼントは届いたかな???"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"受け取りました(`・・)ゞお家に帰ったらイイ感じに飾っておきますねー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"432"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/6909582/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん、すぅちゃんと一緒に応援はダメでしょうか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"433"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/24/6909582/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりひめ単推しがいいのでしょうか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中元推しの方ですかー!ありがとうございます(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今は２人推しでも、そのうちひめたん単推しにさせちゃいますからー♪わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*´・ω・*)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}